  npcIntroDialogue:
  - Hello, dear! Are you the one who is going to help me decorate my room?
  - I just moved into my new house, and the bedroom is still completely empty.
  - "I\u2019d like the room to feel warm and simple."
  - I love reading books before going to bed.
  - It would be wonderful to have a desk and a chair near the window.
  - "Please take good care of this room. I can\u2019t wait to see my new bedroom!"
